    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 7</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be anfealdum ordale.] [Ld, So] ⁊ we cwædon be ðam anfealdum ordale æt þam monnum þe oft betihtlede wæron: ⁊ hy fule wurdon ⁊ hy niten, hwa hy on borh nime, gebringe man hy on carcerne ⁊ man hy do út, swa hit her beforan cweden is.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And we have declared that, with regard to the simple ordeal for men who have often been accused of theft, and have been found guilty, and do not know anyone who will stand as surety for them, they shall be put in prison and they shall be liberated [only] on the conditions stated above.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Be anfealdum ordale. And we cwædon be ðam anfealdum ordale æt ðæm mannum ðe ðeofþe getyhtlod wæron: ⁊ hi fule wyrden ⁊ hí nyten, hwa hi on borh nime, gebringe hine mon on carcerne ⁊ hine man dó ut, swa her beforan gecweden is.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
